    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγᾰλ-ωστί</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, Adv. of
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγας</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>far and wide, over a vast space</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖτο μέγας μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.776
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖσο μέγας μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				20a
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
