				Hdt.
				5.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				28.13.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Zeux.</u>
				8
			</span></i>.— 
				Ep.
			, 
				Ion.
			, and late Prose.</div>
